WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.633
A customer asks for a quote. The request lands in the inbox.

2
00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:10.367
The agent reads it, and finds your price list and similar jobs.

3
00:00:11.567 --> 00:00:16.400
A draft quote is ready. With the right items and your terms.

4
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:24.233
You adjust and approve before anything is sent. The price is always your responsibility.

5
00:00:25.433 --> 00:00:31.267
That is what we set up. In your systems, at a price agreed in advance.
